  "lesson": "## Retrigger on every beat\n\nHot cue 1 on the downbeat of the track; hit it on every beat for 4 bars so the intro stutters in time with the beat. It sounds simple and it is unforgiving: any press off by 30 ms is audible as a flam against the other deck.\n",
